WEBVTT

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.000
Well, that's really cool, 
but what Einstein's really hoping

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.430
is that maybe he'll genetically engineer 
a five-pound peanut.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.000
E: Oh, my God! My God! My God!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.385
SW: Yeah. She would get 
really, really excited.

00:01:09.385 --> 00:01:10.550
(Laughter)

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:12.080
That is one big peanut.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.770
Since Einstein is a bird,

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:16.210
she's very interested in things that fly.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:19.000
She thinks Burt Rutan is very impressive.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:19.600
E: Ooh.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.836
SW: Yeah. She especially likes 
his latest achievement, SpaceShipOne.

00:01:23.836 --> 00:01:26.350
Einstein, would you like to ride 
in Burt's spaceship?

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.220
E: [Spaceship noise]

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.900
SW: Even if it doesn't have a laser?

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.000
E: [Laser noise]

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.000
(Laughter)